en“); Goldmünze in den Taschen, wenn ein Preis gerade 25 % über dem Schnitt liegt", "|cffffd100Gildenbank-Verlauf|r lesbar mit Namensfilter und Wochensumme (|cffe6e0da/gp bank|r, wo es eine Gildenbank gibt)", "|cffffd100Abwesenheit|r: abgemeldete Mitglieder zeigen „abgemeldet bis …“ statt roter Offline-Zeit", "|cffffd100Abfahrten|r: Ankunftszeit am Ziel („Ankunft ~14:32“)", "|cffffd100Einstellungen sichern|r: |cffe6e0da/gp export|r und |cffe6e0da/gp import|r für anderen PC oder Twink", "Preistausch sparsamer: Antworten schicken nur die Tage, die fehlen" },
      en = { "|cffffd100Messenger|r: messages to guild members with GuildPride – even when they are offline. Other members keep the message until delivery (up to 14 days), you see \"delivered\". Goes to the main, so all their characters get it. Window with conversations and history, resizable; speech bubble at the top of the guild window and a count on the minimap button for unread messages. |cffe6e0da/gp messages|r, |cffe6e0da/gp message name text|r", "|cffffd100Whispers in the messenger (like WIM)|r: whoever whispers you gets a conversation and the window opens; also for your own whispers (|cffe6e0da/w|r, R, name menu). Replies in the window are normal whispers, Blizzard's chat stays unchanged. Options: in combat, only guild/friends/group, own whispers", "|cffffd100Welcome window|r for new members: message of the day, guild info, the guild's Discord and community link, question to the officers (|cffe6e0da/gp welcome|r)", "|cffffd100Questions from new members|r: go to all officers through the messenger (even offline); Management › \"Questions from new members\" shows open/answered, reply in the messenger", "|cffffd100Guild links|r: officers enter the guild's own Discord and community link under Management; applies to all members, in the welcome window and in the greeting text as |cffe6e0da{discord}|r and |cffe6e0da{community}|r", "|cffffd100Buff food and rest reminder|r: when \"Well Fed\" runs out, a small window shows the best food for your class from your bags – one click eats it. While levelling the same for sleeping bag and campfire when the rest bonus runs out (|cffe6e0da/gp buff|r, |cffe6e0da/gp rest|r)", "|cffffd100Open dungeons|r (under \"Plan\"): who in the guild still needs which dungeon or raid; a click invites everyone online. The group finder suggests fitting players (\"Online and fitting\")", "|cffffd100Auction house|r: the mailbox sums up sales (\"3 sold, 34g after fee · 1 expired\"); gold coin in your bags when a price is currently 25 % above average", "|cffffd100Guild bank log|r readable with name filter and weekly totals (|cffe6e0da/gp bank|r, where there is a guild bank)", "|cffffd100Absence|r: members who reported absence show \"away until …\" instead of a red offline time", "|cffffd100Departures|r: arrival time at the destination (\"arrives ~14:32\")", "|cffffd100Back up settings|r: |cffe6e0da/gp export|r and |cffe6e0da/gp import|r for another PC or character", "Leaner price exchange: answers only send the days that are missing" } },
